    <item>
      <title>State v. Simulant 7</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/posts/simulant-7/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 07 Jul 2025 10:00:00 -0700</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/posts/simulant-7/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/sim7.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;Simulant 7&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;new-dossier-unlocked-casefilezyjeskicom&#34;&gt;New Dossier Unlocked: casefile.zyjeski.com&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I&amp;rsquo;m excited to announce a new, immersive extension of my fictional universe. I&amp;rsquo;ve just launched a special subdomain, casefile.zyjeski.com, to serve as a home for in-world documents from the futures I&amp;rsquo;m building. This is not just a story; it&amp;rsquo;s an evidence locker, a peek behind the redacted curtain of future justice.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The first file to be declassified is Case #74-AI-CGR-2194 // The State vs. Simulant 7. This is an entry point into a world grappling with the legal and ethical fallout of artificial consciousness. The case comes from the Greater Hartford Consolidated Court, AI Division, and the charges are unprecedented.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Agent/Editor Inquiries</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/inquiries/</link>
      <pubDate>Wed, 30 Apr 2025 12:00:00 -0700</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/inquiries/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;For agent or editor inquiries, please visit &lt;a href=&#34;https://agent.zyjeski.com&#34;&gt;agent.zyjeski.com&lt;/a&gt; or email &lt;a href=&#34;mailto:jeff@zyjeski.com&#34;&gt;jeff@zyjeski.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;the-karmic-protocol&#34;&gt;The Karmic Protocol&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Word Count:&lt;/strong&gt; 89,400 words&lt;br&gt;&#xA;&lt;strong&gt;Genre:&lt;/strong&gt; Speculative thriller with a spiritual edge&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;A quantum VR headset promises rapid Buddhist awakening, igniting a conflict between seekers of digital enlightenment and the corporate-government forces bent on controlling it. Told through alternating third-person perspectives, the story blends technological intrigue with meditative insight. The manuscript is complete, professionally edited, and stands alone while offering series potential.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
