    <item>
      <title>A Thousand Empty Mirrors</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/stories/thousand/thousand/</link>
      <pubDate>Sun, 20 Apr 2025 10:00:00 -0700</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/stories/thousand/thousand/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/uploads/thousand.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;thousand&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;0-03-30-2664-observation-note-final-human-consciousness-archive&#34;&gt;0. &amp;lt;03-30-2664&amp;gt; [Observation Note: Final Human Consciousness Archive]&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The following document appears to be the last unenlightened narrative assembled before the Great Awakening. Format and perspective shifts are preserved as found. Time signatures unclear. Multiple voices detected. Reality status: uncertain.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;1-07-09-2030-laboratory-notes-dr-hadley-genovese&#34;&gt;1. &amp;lt;07-09-2030&amp;gt; [Laboratory Notes, Dr. Hadley Genovese]&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Subject displays typical post-enlightenment characteristics. Constantly looks at his hand. Attempts at measurement continue to fail in interesting ways. Equipment registers quantum impossibilities. Subject smiles. Always smiles.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Bart Higgins</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/stories/bart-higgins/</link>
      <pubDate>Sun, 20 Apr 2025 10:00:00 -0700</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/stories/bart-higgins/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Bartholomew Higgins, or Bart as everyone (eventually) called him, came into the world under a sweltering midday sun. His mom, a woman who collected coincidences like some people collect stamps, swore up and down that was the reason he was, well, relaxed. &amp;ldquo;Born needing a nap,&amp;rdquo; she&amp;rsquo;d say, shaking her head with a mixture of exasperation and a fondness that, if you looked close enough, you could just barely see. Bart? He took it as a sign from the universe. A permission slip, maybe.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Debugging Alexander Kane</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/stories/debug/</link>
      <pubDate>Sat, 12 Apr 2025 08:00:00 -0700</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/stories/debug/</guid>
      <description>&lt;head&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;meta charset=&#34;UTF-8&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;meta name=&#34;viewport&#34; content=&#34;width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;link href=&#34;https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fira+Code:wght@400;500&amp;family=Lora:ital@0;1&amp;display=swap&#34; rel=&#34;stylesheet&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;title&gt;Debug Alexander Kane - Temporal Consciousness Interface&lt;/title&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;style&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        /* Color palette */&#xD;&#xA;        :root {&#xD;&#xA;            --dark-navy: #0a192f;&#xD;&#xA;            --light-navy: #112240;&#xD;&#xA;            --slate: #8892b0;&#xD;&#xA;            --light-slate: #ccd6f6;&#xD;&#xA;            --white: #ffffff;&#xD;&#xA;            --highlight-cyan: #64ffda;&#xD;&#xA;            --accent-yellow: #ffca28;&#xD;&#xA;            --error-red: #e57373;&#xD;&#xA;            --success-green: #51cf66;&#xD;&#xA;            --temporal-purple: #8b5cf6;&#xD;&#xA;        }&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;        * {&#xD;&#xA;            margin: 0;&#xD;&#xA;            padding: 0;&#xD;&#xA;            box-sizing: border-box;&#xD;&#xA;        }&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;        body {&#xD;&#xA;            font-family: &#39;Fira Code&#39;, monospace;&#xD;&#xA;            background-color: var(--dark-navy);&#xD;&#xA;            color: var(--white);&#xD;&#xA;            min-height: 100vh;&#xD;&#xA;            overflow-x: hidden;&#xD;&#xA;            transition: background-color 2s ease;&#xD;&#xA;        }&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;        /* Intro/Outro Screens */&#xD;&#xA;        .screen {&#xD;&#xA;            position: fixed;&#xD;&#xA;            top: 0;&#xD;&#xA;            left: 0;&#xD;&#xA;            width: 100vw;&#xD;&#xA;            height: 100vh;&#xD;&#xA;            display: flex;&#xD;&#xA;            flex-direction: column;&#xD;&#xA;            justify-content: center;&#xD;&#xA;            align-items: center;&#xD;&#xA;            z-index: 10000;&#xD;&#xA;            transition: opacity 1s ease;&#xD;&#xA;        }&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;        .intro-screen {&#xD;&#xA;            background: var(--dark-navy);&#xD;&#xA;            color: var(--highlight-cyan);&#xD;&#xA;        }&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;        .outro-screen {&#xD;&#xA;            background: var(--accent-yellow);&#xD;&#xA;            color: var(--dark-navy);&#xD;&#xA;            display: none;&#xD;&#xA;        }&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;        .screen h1 {&#xD;&#xA;            font-size: 3em;&#xD;&#xA;            margin-bottom: 30px;&#xD;&#xA;            text-align: center;&#xD;&#xA;            text-transform: uppercase;&#xD;&#xA;            letter-spacing: 3px;&#xD;&#xA;        }&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;        .screen p {&#xD;&#xA;            font-family: &#39;Lora&#39;, serif;&#xD;&#xA;            font-size: 1.2em;&#xD;&#xA;            line-height: 1.6;&#xD;&#xA;            max-width: 600px;&#xD;&#xA;            text-align: center;&#xD;&#xA;            margin-bottom: 40px;&#xD;&#xA;        }&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;        .screen button {&#xD;&#xA;            padding: 15px 30px;&#xD;&#xA;            background: transparent;&#xD;&#xA;            border: 2px solid currentColor;&#xD;&#xA;            color: inherit;&#xD;&#xA;            font-family: &#39;Fira Code&#39;, monospace;&#xD;&#xA;            font-size: 1.1em;&#xD;&#xA;            font-weight: bold;&#xD;&#xA;            cursor: pointer;&#xD;&#xA;            border-radius: 8px;&#xD;&#xA;            text-transform: uppercase;&#xD;&#xA;            letter-spacing: 2px;&#xD;&#xA;            transition: all 0.3s ease;&#xD;&#xA;        }&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;        .screen button:hover {&#xD;&#xA;            background: currentColor;&#xD;&#xA;            color: var(--dark-navy);&#xD;&#xA;        }&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;        .screen .footer {&#xD;&#xA;            position: absolute;&#xD;&#xA;            bottom: 30px;&#xD;&#xA;            font-size: 0.9em;&#xD;&#xA;            opacity: 0.8;&#xD;&#xA;        }&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;        .screen .footer a {&#xD;&#xA;            color: inherit;&#xD;&#xA;            text-decoration: none;&#xD;&#xA;            border-bottom: 1px solid currentColor;&#xD;&#xA;        }&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;        .screen .footer a:hover {&#xD;&#xA;            opacity: 0.7;&#xD;&#xA;        }&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;        /* Main app layout */&#xD;&#xA;        .app {&#xD;&#xA;            display: none;&#xD;&#xA;            grid-template-columns: 350px 1fr;&#xD;&#xA;            min-height: 100vh;&#xD;&#xA;            gap: 20px;&#xD;&#xA;            padding: 20px;&#xD;&#xA;        }&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;        .app.active {&#xD;&#xA;            display: grid;&#xD;&#xA;        }&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;        /* Control Panel */&#xD;&#xA;        .control-panel {&#xD;&#xA;            background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(17, 34, 64, 0.9) 0%, rgba(17, 34, 64, 0.6) 100%);&#xD;&#xA;            backdrop-filter: blur(15px);&#xD;&#xA;            border-radius: 12px;&#xD;&#xA;            padding: 25px;&#xD;&#xA;            height: fit-content;&#xD;&#xA;            position: sticky;&#xD;&#xA;            top: 20px;&#xD;&#xA;            border: 1px solid rgba(100, 255, 218, 0.2);&#xD;&#xA;        }&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;        .panel-header {&#xD;&#xA;            text-align: center;&#xD;&#xA;            margin-bottom: 25px;&#xD;&#xA;            padding-bottom: 20px;&#xD;&#xA;            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(100, 255, 218, 0.3);&#xD;&#xA;        }&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;        .panel-title {&#xD;&#xA;            color: var(--highlight-cyan);&#xD;&#xA;            font-size: 1.3em;&#xD;&#xA;            margin-bottom: 10px;&#xD;&#xA;            text-transform: uppercase;&#xD;&#xA;            letter-spacing: 2px;&#xD;&#xA;        }&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;        .panel-subtitle {&#xD;&#xA;            color: var(--light-slate);&#xD;&#xA;            font-family: &#39;Lora&#39;, serif;&#xD;&#xA;            font-style: italic;&#xD;&#xA;            font-size: 0.9em;&#xD;&#xA;        }&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;        /* Metrics */&#xD;&#xA;        .metrics-section h3 {&#xD;&#xA;            color: var(--highlight-cyan);&#xD;&#xA;            font-size: 1em;&#xD;&#xA;            margin-bottom: 15px;&#xD;&#xA;            text-transform: uppercase;&#xD;&#xA;            letter-spacing: 1px;&#xD;&#xA;        }&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;        .metric {&#xD;&#xA;            margin-bottom: 12px;&#xD;&#xA;            padding: 12px;&#xD;&#xA;            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);&#xD;&#xA;            border-radius: 6px;&#xD;&#xA;            border-left: 3px solid var(--success-green);&#xD;&#xA;            transition: all 0.3s ease;&#xD;&#xA;        }&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;        .metric label {&#xD;&#xA;            display: block;&#xD;&#xA;            color: var(--light-slate);&#xD;&#xA;            font-size: 0.85em;&#xD;&#xA;            margin-bottom: 6px;&#xD;&#xA;        }&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;        .metric-value {&#xD;&#xA;            font-family: &#39;Fira Code&#39;, monospace;&#xD;&#xA;            font-size: 1em;&#xD;&#xA;            color: var(--accent-yellow);&#xD;&#xA;            transition: all 1s ease-in-out;&#xD;&#xA;        }&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;        /* Controls */&#xD;&#xA;        .controls {&#xD;&#xA;            margin-top: 25px;&#xD;&#xA;        }&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;        .controls h3 {&#xD;&#xA;            color: var(--highlight-cyan);&#xD;&#xA;            font-size: 1em;&#xD;&#xA;            margin-bottom: 15px;&#xD;&#xA;            text-transform: uppercase;&#xD;&#xA;            letter-spacing: 1px;&#xD;&#xA;        }&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;        .controls button {&#xD;&#xA;            width: 100%;&#xD;&#xA;            padding: 14px;&#xD;&#xA;            margin-bottom: 12px;&#xD;&#xA;            background: transparent;&#xD;&#xA;            border: 2px solid var(--highlight-cyan);&#xD;&#xA;            color: var(--highlight-cyan);&#xD;&#xA;            border-radius: 8px;&#xD;&#xA;            font-family: &#39;Fira Code&#39;, monospace;&#xD;&#xA;            font-weight: bold;&#xD;&#xA;            font-size: 0.95em;&#xD;&#xA;            cursor: pointer;&#xD;&#xA;            transition: all 0.3s ease;&#xD;&#xA;            text-transform: uppercase;&#xD;&#xA;            letter-spacing: 1px;&#xD;&#xA;        }&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;        .controls button:hover:not(:disabled) {&#xD;&#xA;            background: rgba(100, 255, 218, 0.15);&#xD;&#xA;            transform: translateY(-2px);&#xD;&#xA;        }&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;        .controls button:disabled {&#xD;&#xA;            border-color: var(--slate);&#xD;&#xA;            color: var(--slate);&#xD;&#xA;            cursor: not-allowed;&#xD;&#xA;            transform: none;&#xD;&#xA;        }&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;        /* Main content */&#xD;&#xA;        .main-content {&#xD;&#xA;            display: flex;&#xD;&#xA;            flex-direction: column;&#xD;&#xA;            align-items: center;&#xD;&#xA;            padding: 20px;&#xD;&#xA;        }&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;        /* Memory fragments */&#xD;&#xA;        .memory-fragments {&#xD;&#xA;            position: relative;&#xD;&#xA;            width: 100%;&#xD;&#xA;            max-width: 1000px;&#xD;&#xA;            height: 350px;&#xD;&#xA;            margin: 20px 0;&#xD;&#xA;        }&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;        .fragment {&#xD;&#xA;            position: absolute;&#xD;&#xA;            width: 200px;&#xD;&#xA;            height: 240px;&#xD;&#xA;            background: var(--light-navy);&#xD;&#xA;            border-radius: 12px;&#xD;&#xA;            padding: 15px;&#xD;&#xA;            transform: rotate(5deg);&#xD;&#xA;            transition: all 0.3s ease;&#xD;&#xA;            cursor: pointer;&#xD;&#xA;            border: 1px solid rgba(100, 255, 218, 0.2);&#xD;&#xA;            display: none;&#xD;&#xA;        }&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;        .fragment.visible {&#xD;&#xA;            display: block;&#xD;&#xA;        }&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;        .fragment:hover {&#xD;&#xA;            transform: rotate(0deg) translateY(-5px);&#xD;&#xA;        }&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;        .fragment.fragment--error {&#xD;&#xA;            filter: blur(2px);&#xD;&#xA;            animation: shake 0.5s ease-in-out;&#xD;&#xA;        }&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;        @keyframes shake {&#xD;&#xA;            0%, 100% { transform: rotate(5deg); }&#xD;&#xA;            25% { transform: rotate(3deg) translateX(-2px); }&#xD;&#xA;            75% { transform: rotate(7deg) translateX(2px); }&#xD;&#xA;        }&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;        /* Consistent positioning for all fragments to avoid overlap with content below */&#xD;&#xA;        .fragment:nth-child(1) { left: 15%; top: 10%; }&#xD;&#xA;        .fragment:nth-child(2) { right: 15%; top: 20%; transform: rotate(-4deg); }&#xD;&#xA;        .fragment:nth-child(3) { left: 50%; top: 5%; transform: translateX(-50%) rotate(3deg); }&#xD;&#xA;        .fragment:nth-child(4) { left: 25%; top: 35%; transform: rotate(-3deg); }&#xD;&#xA;        .fragment:nth-child(5) { right: 25%; top: 25%; transform: rotate(4deg); }&#xD;&#xA;        .fragment:nth-child(6) { left: 60%; top: 40%; transform: rotate(-5deg); }&#xD;&#xA;        .fragment:nth-child(7) { left: 10%; top: 30%; transform: rotate(2deg); }&#xD;&#xA;        .fragment:nth-child(8) { right: 10%; top: 30%; transform: rotate(-3deg); }&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;        .fragment-header {&#xD;&#xA;            color: var(--highlight-cyan);&#xD;&#xA;            font-size: 0.9em;&#xD;&#xA;            margin-bottom: 10px;&#xD;&#xA;            text-transform: uppercase;&#xD;&#xA;            letter-spacing: 1px;&#xD;&#xA;            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(100, 255, 218, 0.3);&#xD;&#xA;            padding-bottom: 8px;&#xD;&#xA;        }&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;        .fragment-image {&#xD;&#xA;            width: 100%;&#xD;&#xA;            height: 80px;&#xD;&#xA;            background: #2d3748;&#xD;&#xA;            border-radius: 6px;&#xD;&#xA;            margin-bottom: 12px;&#xD;&#xA;            border: 1px solid #4a5568;&#xD;&#xA;            display: flex;&#xD;&#xA;            align-items: center;&#xD;&#xA;            justify-content: center;&#xD;&#xA;            font-size: 2em;&#xD;&#xA;            opacity: 0.7;&#xD;&#xA;        }&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;        .fragment-text {&#xD;&#xA;            color: var(--light-slate);&#xD;&#xA;            font-family: &#39;Lora&#39;, serif;&#xD;&#xA;            font-size: 0.8em;&#xD;&#xA;            line-height: 1.4;&#xD;&#xA;            font-style: italic;&#xD;&#xA;        }&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;        /* Status indicator instead of brain */&#xD;&#xA;        .status-indicator {&#xD;&#xA;            width: 200px;&#xD;&#xA;            height: 60px;&#xD;&#xA;            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--dark-navy) 0%, var(--light-navy) 50%, var(--dark-navy) 100%);&#xD;&#xA;            border: 2px solid var(--highlight-cyan);&#xD;&#xA;            border-radius: 30px;&#xD;&#xA;            margin: 20px 0;&#xD;&#xA;            display: flex;&#xD;&#xA;            align-items: center;&#xD;&#xA;            justify-content: center;&#xD;&#xA;            position: relative;&#xD;&#xA;            overflow: hidden;&#xD;&#xA;        }&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;        .status-indicator::before {&#xD;&#xA;            content: &#39;&#39;;&#xD;&#xA;            position: absolute;&#xD;&#xA;            top: 0;&#xD;&#xA;            left: -100%;&#xD;&#xA;            width: 100%;&#xD;&#xA;            height: 100%;&#xD;&#xA;            background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(100, 255, 218, 0.3), transparent);&#xD;&#xA;            animation: scan 2s infinite;&#xD;&#xA;        }&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;        @keyframes scan {&#xD;&#xA;            0% { left: -100%; }&#xD;&#xA;            100% { left: 100%; }&#xD;&#xA;        }&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;        .status-indicator.status--error {&#xD;&#xA;            border-color: var(--error-red);&#xD;&#xA;            box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(229, 115, 115, 0.5);&#xD;&#xA;        }&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;        .status-indicator.status--error::before {&#xD;&#xA;            background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(229, 115, 115, 0.3), transparent);&#xD;&#xA;        }&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;        .status-indicator.status--patched {&#xD;&#xA;            border-color: var(--accent-yellow);&#xD;&#xA;            box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(255, 202, 40, 0.5);&#xD;&#xA;        }&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;        .status-indicator.status--patched::before {&#xD;&#xA;            background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(255, 202, 40, 0.3), transparent);&#xD;&#xA;        }&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;        .status-text {&#xD;&#xA;            color: var(--white);&#xD;&#xA;            font-family: &#39;Fira Code&#39;, monospace;&#xD;&#xA;            font-size: 0.9em;&#xD;&#xA;            text-transform: uppercase;&#xD;&#xA;            letter-spacing: 1px;&#xD;&#xA;            z-index: 1;&#xD;&#xA;        }&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;        /* Content layout improvements */&#xD;&#xA;        .content-grid {&#xD;&#xA;            display: grid;&#xD;&#xA;            grid-template-columns: 400px 1fr;&#xD;&#xA;            gap: 30px;&#xD;&#xA;            width: 100%;&#xD;&#xA;            max-width: 1400px;&#xD;&#xA;            margin: 20px 0;&#xD;&#xA;        }&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;        .left-column {&#xD;&#xA;            display: flex;&#xD;&#xA;            flex-direction: column;&#xD;&#xA;        }&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;        .right-column {&#xD;&#xA;            display: flex;&#xD;&#xA;            flex-direction: column;&#xD;&#xA;        }&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;        /* Error log */&#xD;&#xA;        .error-log {&#xD;&#xA;            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);&#xD;&#xA;            border-radius: 8px;&#xD;&#xA;            padding: 20px;&#xD;&#xA;            border-left: 4px solid var(--error-red);&#xD;&#xA;            height: 200px;&#xD;&#xA;            overflow-y: auto;&#xD;&#xA;        }&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;        .error-log h3 {&#xD;&#xA;            color: var(--error-red);&#xD;&#xA;            font-size: 1.1em;&#xD;&#xA;            margin-bottom: 15px;&#xD;&#xA;            text-transform: uppercase;&#xD;&#xA;            letter-spacing: 1px;&#xD;&#xA;        }&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;        .error-entry {&#xD;&#xA;            font-family: &#39;Fira Code&#39;, monospace;&#xD;&#xA;            font-size: 0.85em;&#xD;&#xA;            color: var(--light-slate);&#xD;&#xA;            margin-bottom: 8px;&#xD;&#xA;            opacity: 0;&#xD;&#xA;            animation: typewriter 1s ease-out forwards;&#xD;&#xA;        }&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;        @keyframes typewriter {&#xD;&#xA;            from { &#xD;&#xA;                width: 0; &#xD;&#xA;                opacity: 0;&#xD;&#xA;            }&#xD;&#xA;            to { &#xD;&#xA;                width: 100%; &#xD;&#xA;                opacity: 1;&#xD;&#xA;            }&#xD;&#xA;        }&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;        /* Story display */&#xD;&#xA;        .story-display {&#xD;&#xA;            background: rgba(17, 34, 64, 0.6);&#xD;&#xA;            border-radius: 8px;&#xD;&#xA;            padding: 20px;&#xD;&#xA;            border-left: 4px solid var(--temporal-purple);&#xD;&#xA;            display: none;&#xD;&#xA;            height: 200px;&#xD;&#xA;            overflow-y: auto;&#xD;&#xA;        }&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;        .story-display.active {&#xD;&#xA;            display: block;&#xD;&#xA;            animation: fadeInUp 0.8s ease-out;&#xD;&#xA;        }&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;        @keyframes fadeInUp {&#xD;&#xA;            from {&#xD;&#xA;                opacity: 0;&#xD;&#xA;                transform: translateY(20px);&#xD;&#xA;            }&#xD;&#xA;            to {&#xD;&#xA;                opacity: 1;&#xD;&#xA;                transform: translateY(0);&#xD;&#xA;            }&#xD;&#xA;        }&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;        .story-display h3 {&#xD;&#xA;            color: var(--temporal-purple);&#xD;&#xA;            font-size: 1.1em;&#xD;&#xA;            margin-bottom: 15px;&#xD;&#xA;            text-transform: uppercase;&#xD;&#xA;            letter-spacing: 2px;&#xD;&#xA;        }&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;        .story-display p {&#xD;&#xA;            font-family: &#39;Lora&#39;, serif;&#xD;&#xA;            font-size: 0.95em;&#xD;&#xA;            line-height: 1.6;&#xD;&#xA;            color: var(--light-slate);&#xD;&#xA;            margin-bottom: 15px;&#xD;&#xA;        }&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;        /* Modal */&#xD;&#xA;        .modal {&#xD;&#xA;            position: fixed;&#xD;&#xA;            top: 0;&#xD;&#xA;            left: 0;&#xD;&#xA;            width: 100vw;&#xD;&#xA;            height: 100vh;&#xD;&#xA;            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);&#xD;&#xA;            backdrop-filter: blur(5px);&#xD;&#xA;            display: none;&#xD;&#xA;            justify-content: center;&#xD;&#xA;            align-items: center;&#xD;&#xA;            z-index: 1000;&#xD;&#xA;        }&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;        .modal.active {&#xD;&#xA;            display: flex;&#xD;&#xA;        }&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;        .modal-content {&#xD;&#xA;            background: var(--dark-navy);&#xD;&#xA;            color: var(--white);&#xD;&#xA;            max-width: 600px;&#xD;&#xA;            width: 90%;&#xD;&#xA;            max-height: 80vh;&#xD;&#xA;            overflow-y: auto;&#xD;&#xA;            border-radius: 12px;&#xD;&#xA;            padding: 30px;&#xD;&#xA;            border: 1px solid var(--highlight-cyan);&#xD;&#xA;        }&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;        .modal-header {&#xD;&#xA;            color: var(--highlight-cyan);&#xD;&#xA;            font-size: 1.3em;&#xD;&#xA;            margin-bottom: 20px;&#xD;&#xA;            text-transform: uppercase;&#xD;&#xA;            letter-spacing: 2px;&#xD;&#xA;        }&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;        .modal-text {&#xD;&#xA;            font-family: &#39;Lora&#39;, serif;&#xD;&#xA;            font-size: 1em;&#xD;&#xA;            line-height: 1.7;&#xD;&#xA;            color: var(--light-slate);&#xD;&#xA;        }&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;        .modal-close {&#xD;&#xA;            position: absolute;&#xD;&#xA;            top: 15px;&#xD;&#xA;            right: 20px;&#xD;&#xA;            background: none;&#xD;&#xA;            border: none;&#xD;&#xA;            color: var(--highlight-cyan);&#xD;&#xA;            font-size: 1.5em;&#xD;&#xA;            cursor: pointer;&#xD;&#xA;            padding: 5px;&#xD;&#xA;        }&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;        /* Final state styling */&#xD;&#xA;        .final-state {&#xD;&#xA;            background: var(--accent-yellow);&#xD;&#xA;            transition: background-color 2s ease;&#xD;&#xA;        }&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;        .final-state .brain-svg {&#xD;&#xA;            filter: drop-shadow(0 0 20px var(--accent-yellow));&#xD;&#xA;        }&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;        /* Accessibility */&#xD;&#xA;        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {&#xD;&#xA;            *, *::before, *::after {&#xD;&#xA;                animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;&#xD;&#xA;                animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;&#xD;&#xA;                transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;&#xD;&#xA;            }&#xD;&#xA;        }&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;        /* Responsive */&#xD;&#xA;        @media (max-width: 1024px) {&#xD;&#xA;            .app {&#xD;&#xA;                grid-template-columns: 1fr;&#xD;&#xA;                gap: 15px;&#xD;&#xA;            }&#xD;&#xA;            &#xD;&#xA;            .control-panel {&#xD;&#xA;                position: static;&#xD;&#xA;                order: 2;&#xD;&#xA;            }&#xD;&#xA;            &#xD;&#xA;            .main-content {&#xD;&#xA;                order: 1;&#xD;&#xA;            }&#xD;&#xA;            &#xD;&#xA;            .content-grid {&#xD;&#xA;                grid-template-columns: 1fr;&#xD;&#xA;                gap: 20px;&#xD;&#xA;            }&#xD;&#xA;        }&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;        @media (max-width: 768px) {&#xD;&#xA;            .fragment {&#xD;&#xA;                width: 180px;&#xD;&#xA;                height: 220px;&#xD;&#xA;                padding: 12px;&#xD;&#xA;            }&#xD;&#xA;            &#xD;&#xA;            .fragment-image {&#xD;&#xA;                height: 60px;&#xD;&#xA;            }&#xD;&#xA;            &#xD;&#xA;            .screen h1 {&#xD;&#xA;                font-size: 2em;&#xD;&#xA;            }&#xD;&#xA;            &#xD;&#xA;            .screen p {&#xD;&#xA;                font-size: 1em;&#xD;&#xA;            }&#xD;&#xA;            &#xD;&#xA;            .status-indicator {&#xD;&#xA;                width: 150px;&#xD;&#xA;                height: 50px;&#xD;&#xA;            }&#xD;&#xA;            &#xD;&#xA;            .memory-fragments {&#xD;&#xA;                height: 300px;&#xD;&#xA;            }&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;            .content-grid {&#xD;&#xA;                max-width: 100%;&#xD;&#xA;            }&#xD;&#xA;        }&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;/style&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;/head&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;body&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;!-- Intro Screen --&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;screen intro-screen&#34; id=&#34;intro-screen&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;h1&gt;Debug Alexander Kane&lt;/h1&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;p&gt;In Chronopolis, time is fractured. Dr. Alexander Kane&#39;s mind has crashed after a Time Quake erased his son, Leo. Debug his consciousness to stabilize his grief and the city&#39;s timelines.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Eigenstate Cascade</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/stories/eigenstate/</link>
      <pubDate>Sat, 05 Apr 2025 14:00:00 -0700</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/stories/eigenstate/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;The fluorescent lights clicked on one by one, casting shadows across the humming lab. Eppy stood in the doorway for a moment, breathing in the sterile air. 6:00 AM glowed on the wall clock. Exactly on time.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;He moved Sasha&amp;rsquo;s abandoned coffee mug to the edge of her empty desk, aligning the handle at precisely ninety degrees. Three weeks since she&amp;rsquo;d left for CERN, taking half their research and all of their late-night conversations. The lab felt hollow without her tuneless humming.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>There Are No Humans</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/books/there-are-no-humans/</link>
      <pubDate>Thu, 03 Apr 2025 12:27:25 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/books/there-are-no-humans/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&amp;ldquo;There are no humans&amp;rdquo; is a thought-provoking novella exploring consciousness, reality, and the search for meaning in a universe devoid of human life. This unique narrative blends philosophical inquiry with an emotional core, culminating in a stunning revelation that will challenge your perception of existence.&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Dive into this mind-bending exploration of:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Artificial intelligence and sentience&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;The nature of reality&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;The search for meaning and connection&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;The illusion of self&#xA;If you like philosophical fiction with a touch of the uncanny, you&amp;rsquo;ll love &amp;ldquo;There are no humans.&amp;rdquo;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>About</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/about/</link>
      <pubDate>Sun, 30 Mar 2025 08:00:00 -0700</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/about/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;jeffrey-a-zyjeski&#34;&gt;Jeffrey A. Zyjeski&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;contact&#34;&gt;Contact&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;For inquiries, collaborations, or conversations at the edge of code and consciousness:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Email: &lt;a href=&#34;mailto:jeff@zyjeski.com&#34;&gt;jeff@zyjeski.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Twitter: &lt;a href=&#34;https://twitter.com/zekusmaximus&#34;&gt;@zekusmaximus&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Instagram: &lt;a href=&#34;https://instagram.com/zekusmaximus&#34;&gt;@zekusmaximus&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Jeffrey A. Zyjeski explores the intersection of technology and spirituality through fiction, koan-like short works, and audio experiences. His work examines how digital consciousness and mystical traditions might converge in a near-future where reality is increasingly mediated by technology.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Drawing from both cyberpunk aesthetics and contemplative practices, Zyjeski&amp;rsquo;s &amp;ldquo;Neuro-Digital Enlightenment&amp;rdquo; philosophy proposes that technological disruption of conventional consciousness may open pathways to insights traditionally sought through spiritual disciplines.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Meditation as Debugging</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/posts/first-post/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 25 Mar 2025 09:30:00 -0700</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/posts/first-post/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;meditation-as-debugging-runtime-errors-in-consciousness&#34;&gt;Meditation as Debugging: Runtime Errors in Consciousness&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;In both meditation and programming, we confront similar patterns. The untrained mind generates error messages we typically ignore: anxiety loops, judgment routines, identity verification checks. These cognitive subroutines consume processing resources and maintain what Buddhist traditions call dukkha—a persistent background process of dissatisfaction.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;When we sit in meditation, we&amp;rsquo;re essentially reviewing our consciousness codebase in real-time. We watch thoughts arise without immediately executing them. We observe emotional states as they compile. We witness the self-referential loops that maintain the illusion of a static identity.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Guided Neural Rebooting Protocol</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/audio/first-simulation/</link>
      <pubDate>Sat, 15 Mar 2025 14:00:00 -0700</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/audio/first-simulation/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;This Neural Rebooting Protocol simulation guides listeners through a meditative &amp;ldquo;shutdown and restart&amp;rdquo; of ordinary consciousness. The practice draws from both contemplative traditions and computational metaphors to facilitate a direct experience of non-dual awareness.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The simulation uses carefully calibrated binaural audio to facilitate alpha and theta brainwave states associated with deep meditation. The narrator&amp;rsquo;s guidance helps dissolve the subject/object boundary that reinforces conventional identity.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Regular practice of this protocol may help reduce identification with limiting thought patterns and cultivate a more flexible relationship with conscious experience.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>The Karmic Protocol</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/books/the-protocol-vol1/</link>
      <pubDate>Sat, 15 Feb 2025 10:00:00 -0700</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/books/the-protocol-vol1/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;In the near future, a team of dedicated meditators creates a quantum-powered virtual reality headset that accelerates spiritual awakening. Their breakthrough—known as The Karmic Protocol—offers a path to digital enlightenment, but its potential threatens powerful corporations, government agencies, and religious institutions. As pressure mounts to control or suppress the technology, the group must decide whether to risk unleashing a revolution of consciousness. Can society built on desire survive when freedom from those desires is suddenly within reach?&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>The Compiler Cannot Compile Itself</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/stories/first-koan/</link>
      <pubDate>Fri, 10 Jan 2025 11:00:00 -0700</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/stories/first-koan/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;In the echo chamber of recursive logic, a student approached the master programmer.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&amp;ldquo;I have built an advanced AI that can optimize any codebase,&amp;rdquo; said the student. &amp;ldquo;But when I direct it to optimize itself, it crashes.&amp;rdquo;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The master nodded. &amp;ldquo;Show me the error message.&amp;rdquo;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The student displayed the terminal output:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;&#xD; ERROR: Self-reference recursion depth exceeded&#xD; System halted: Observer cannot fully observe itself&#xD; &lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&amp;ldquo;I&amp;rsquo;ve tried implementing stable self-reference loops,&amp;rdquo; said the student, &amp;ldquo;but each solution creates new problems.&amp;rdquo;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
